    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats or unintended weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision, flashes or floaters</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing loss or ringing; breathes well through the nose</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heartburn, stomach pain, black stools or change in bowel habit</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low back ache easing; left thumb sore after gripping</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No new or changing skin spots</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headaches, dizziness, memory trouble or leg weakness; the numbness on the top of the left foot has faded</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-2 0; not worried or tense</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>11 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
