  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Chronic mechanical low back pain for about seven years of heavy training and fighting, aching across the lower back, worse after long drives and in the morning</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>M54.59</td><td>S — Synthetic chronic back pain anchored to his documented back injuries during his career.</td>
