    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary discussion of about 15 minutes, with his consent. He named a health care agent, recorded in the chart and not named here, and completed a health care proxy form. He said he would want full treatment for any injury or illness from which he could recover. The plan will be revisited every few years or after any serious illness. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
